Commercial Use
--------------
Commercial use of Iron Dome requires a license from KirkForge.
This includes but is not limited to:
- Use within a commercial organization or business
- Integration into commercial products or services
- Use by teams within a company (regardless of team size)
- Use in CI/CD pipelines for commercial software development
- Use by contractors working on behalf of a commercial entity

For commercial licensing, see https://github.com/KirkForge/Shogun or
contact licensing@kirkforge.com.

